<p data-start=3D"6968" data-end=3D"6985" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"6=
968" data-end=3D"6985">Explication :</strong></p>
<ul data-start=3D"6986" data-end=3D"7218">
<li data-start=3D"6986" data-end=3D"7069" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"6988" data-end=3D"7069" class=3D"">Si une erreur se produi=
t dans le bloc <code data-start=3D"7026" data-end=3D"7031">try</code>, l'in=
struction <code data-start=3D"7047" data-end=3D"7055">except</code> est ex=
=C3=A9cut=C3=A9e.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7070" data-end=3D"7142" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7072" data-end=3D"7142" class=3D"">Le bloc <code data-star=
t=3D"7080" data-end=3D"7086">else</code> est ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9 uniquement s=
i aucune erreur n'est survenue.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"7143" data-end=3D"7218" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"7145" data-end=3D"7218" class=3D"">Le bloc <code data-star=
t=3D"7153" data-end=3D"7162">finally</code> est ex=C3=A9cut=C3=A9 =C3=A0 la=
 fin, qu'il y ait eu ou non une erreur.</p>
</li>
</ul>
