<li data-start=3D"1013" data-end=3D"1125" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1016" data-end=3D"1125" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"1=
016" data-end=3D"1038">Variables globales</strong> =E2=80=93 D=C3=A9finies =
