<h2 data-start=3D"4664" data-end=3D"4731" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
4667" data-end=3D"4731">4. Comparaison entre Recherche Lin=C3=A9aire et Rec=
herche Binaire</strong></h2>
<div class=3D"overflow-x-auto contain-inline-size"><table data-start=3D"473=
3" data-end=3D"5412" node=3D"[object Object]"><thead data-start=3D"4733" da=
ta-end=3D"4825"><tr data-start=3D"4733" data-end=3D"4825"><th data-start=3D=
"4733" data-end=3D"4765">Crit=C3=A8re</th><th data-start=3D"4765" data-end=
=3D"4794">Recherche Lin=C3=A9aire</th><th data-start=3D"4794" data-end=3D"4=
