vant red=C3=A9finir certaines m=C3=A9thodes sp=C3=A9cifiques =C3=A0 la clas=
se <code data-start=3D"7215" data-end=3D"7222">Chien</code>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"7225" data-end=3D"7228" class=3D"">
<h2 data-start=3D"7230" data-end=3D"7253" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
7233" data-end=3D"7253">6. Polymorphisme</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"7255" data-end=3D"7420" class=3D"">Le <strong data-start=
=3D"7258" data-end=3D"7275">polymorphisme</strong> est un concept qui perme=
t =C3=A0 des objets de classes diff=C3=A9rentes d=E2=80=99=C3=AAtre trait=
=C3=A9s de la m=C3=AAme mani=C3=A8re tout en conservant leur comportement s=
p=C3=A9cifique.</p>
