<h2 data-start=3D"2837" data-end=3D"2865" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"=
2840" data-end=3D"2865">2. M=C3=A9thodes en Python</strong></h2>
<p data-start=3D"2867" data-end=3D"3138" class=3D"">Les <strong data-start=
=3D"2871" data-end=3D"2883">m=C3=A9thodes</strong> sont des fonctions d=C3=
