142" data-end=3D"3165">M=C3=A9thodes d'instance</strong> : M=C3=A9thodes qu=
i op=C3=A8rent sur une instance sp=C3=A9cifique de la classe.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3231" data-end=3D"3303" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3233" data-end=3D"3303" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
233" data-end=3D"3255">M=C3=A9thodes de classe</strong> : M=C3=A9thodes qui=
 op=C3=A8rent sur la classe elle-m=C3=AAme.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"3304" data-end=3D"3432" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"3306" data-end=3D"3432" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"3=
306" data-end=3D"3328">M=C3=A9thodes statiques</strong> : M=C3=A9thodes qui=
 ne d=C3=A9pendent ni de l'instance ni de la classe, mais qui effectuent de=
s t=C3=A2ches g=C3=A9n=C3=A9rales.</p>
</li>
</ul>
