056" data-end=3D"8073"><code data-start=3D"8058" data-end=3D"8071">__getatt=
r__</code></strong> : Appel=C3=A9e lorsque vous tentez d'acc=C3=A9der =C3=
=A0 un attribut inexistant.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8140" data-end=3D"8201" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8142" data-end=3D"8201" class=3D""><strong data-start=3D"8=
