=C3=A9s sp=C3=A9cifiques. Il existe deux types d'h=C3=A9ritage en Python : =
<strong data-start=3D"912" data-end=3D"933">l'h=C3=A9ritage simple</strong>=
 et <strong data-start=3D"937" data-end=3D"960">l'h=C3=A9ritage multiple</s=
