=3D"940" data-end=3D"990">Pourquoi Cr=C3=A9er des Exceptions Personnalis=C3=
=A9es ?</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"992" data-end=3D"1324" class=3D"">Python fournit de nombre=
uses exceptions int=C3=A9gr=C3=A9es comme <code data-start=3D"1048" data-en=
