<h3 data-start=3D"7291" data-end=3D"7333" class=3D"">4.1 <strong data-start=
=3D"7299" data-end=3D"7333">Nommer les Modules et Packages</strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"7335" data-end=3D"7446" class=3D"">Il est important de sui=
