>
<ul data-start=3D"8288" data-end=3D"8727">
<li data-start=3D"8288" data-end=3D"8357" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8290" data-end=3D"8357" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"8293" data-end=3D"8303">module</strong> est un fichier Python contenant=
 du code r=C3=A9utilisable.</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"8358" data-end=3D"8428" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8360" data-end=3D"8428" class=3D"">Un <strong data-start=
=3D"8363" data-end=3D"8374">package</strong> est un ensemble de modules org=
