</li>
<li data-start=3D"8429" data-end=3D"8506" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"8431" data-end=3D"8506" class=3D"">Utilisez l'instruction =
<code data-start=3D"8454" data-end=3D"8462">import</code> pour importer des=
