<h2 data-start=3D"6901" data-end=3D"6961" class=3D"">5. <strong data-start=
=3D"6907" data-end=3D"6961">Gestion des D=C3=A9pendances et Distribution du=
 Package</strong></h2>
<h3 data-start=3D"6963" data-end=3D"6993" class=3D"">5.1 <strong data-start=
=3D"6971" data-end=3D"6993">Fichier <code data-start=3D"6981" data-end=3D"6=
991">setup.py</code></strong></h3>
<p data-start=3D"6995" data-end=3D"7258" class=3D"">Si vous souhaitez distr=
ibuer votre package ou le partager avec d=E2=80=99autres, vous devez inclur=
