<li data-start=3D"1899" data-end=3D"1962" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1901" data-end=3D"1962" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"190=
1" data-end=3D"1906">'a'</code> : Ajouter (ajoute au fichier sans =C3=A9cra=
ser son contenu).</p>
</li>
<li data-start=3D"1963" data-end=3D"2024" class=3D"">
<p data-start=3D"1965" data-end=3D"2024" class=3D""><code data-start=3D"196=
5" data-end=3D"1970">'x'</code> : Cr=C3=A9er un fichier (=C3=A9chec si le f=
